    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1190a-a19">

                <pb facs="1272" n="1176" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1176"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-06-29"><hi rendition="#italic">June 29,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In addition to blockade of ports specified in his proclamation of April 22, 1898,
                    President, by proclamation dated June 27, announces blockade of all the ports on
                    the south coast of Cuba from Cape Frances to Cape Cruz, inclusive; also San
                    Juan, Puerto Rico. Notify minister for foreign affairs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
